    <h3>Introduction to HTML:-</h3>

    <p><b>(i) What is HTML?</b></p>
    <p>HTML (Hyper Text Markup Language) is a web-based  language that tells your browser how to showcase text and images on a webpage. You use tags to indicate the various elements, determine the placement of paragraphs, headings, add images and videos.</p>

