        <li>Make your content easy to digest</li>
    </ol>

    <p><b>What are the versions of HTML?</b></p>
    <p>Since its launch in 1990, HTML has had five versions to date.<br>
        HTML - the original version published in 1990.<br>
        HTML 2 - published on November 24, 1995.<br>
        HTML 3 - published on January 14, 1997.<br>
        HTML 4 - published on December 18,1997.<br>
        And the most recent and most important one - HTML 5.</p>
    

